      }
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "ListItem",
    "element_id": "adc0d14d618e8e61917e957ef7b55231",
    "text": "3. If I delete wrong info, it still shows red and looks like I can't save even though I can. Suggest removing red outline from non compulsory fields.",
